\v 2 until¦81670 the day¦81672 when he was taken¦81682 up\x + \xo 1:1: \xt Luk 24:51.\x* \add into the sky\add* after, with the help of the holy¦81679 \nd spirit¦81678\nd*, having¦81674 commanded¦81674 the missionaries that he had chosen¦81681.
\s1 Yeshua, alive, tells them to wait
\p
\v 3 After the time¦81696 of his suffering¦81697, Yeshua presented¦81692 himself¦81693 to them in ways that were infallible proofs¦81701 \add that he was alive again\add*—appearing¦81706 to them and¦81709 telling¦81710 them about God's kingdom¦81715.
