\v 8 \wj However, you¦81815 all¦81815 will be receiving¦81815 power¦81816 when the holy¦81819 \+nd spirit¦81820\+nd* lands on you. Then you'll tell \+add people\+add* about me in Yerushalem¦81830 and all across \+add the provinces of\+add* Yudea¦81835 and Shomron¦81837 \+add (Samaria)\+add*, and all the way to the furthest parts of the planet.\wj*”\x + \xo 1:8: \xt Mat 28:19; Mrk 16:15; Luk 24:47-48.\x*
\v 9 After he'd said¦81846 that and¦81844 while they were still looking at him, he was lifted¦81853 up \add into the sky\add* until they could no longer see¦81851 him because of the \add #clouds¦81855\add*.\x + \xo 1:9: \xt Mrk 16:19; Luk 24:50-51.\x*
\p
\v 10 As they¦81868 stood¦81878 there staring into the sky¦81871 after he'd gone, suddenly two¦81877 men¦81876 in white¦81885 clothes¦81882 were standing beside them
\v 11 and said¦81888, “You men from Galilee¦81890! Why are you still standing¦81892 there looking¦81893 up at the sky¦81897? This \nd Yeshua\nd* who's been taken¦81902 up away from you into heaven will come¦81909 back in the same way that¦81901 you saw¦81912 him¦81913 go¦81914 up into heaven.”
\s1 Matthias replaces Yudas Iscariot
\rem /s1 The church in Jerusalem; Matthias Chosen to Replace Judas; Matthias Replaces Judas; Judas' Successor
\p
\v 12 Then¦81930 they¦81919 walked down the Mt¦81923. of Olives¦81926 and returned¦81919 to Yerushalem¦81921 which was less than a kilometre away.
\v 13 They went¦81944 into the upstairs¦81943 room¦81943 where¦81945 they were staying¦81947—Peter¦81950 and Yohan¦81953, Yacob and Andrew¦81958, Philip¦81959 and Thomas¦81961, Bartholomew¦81962 and Matthew¦81964, Yacob (son of Alfeus), Simon¦81970 (the Zealot member¦81972), and Yudas¦81974 (son of Yacob).\x + \xo 1:13: \xt Mat 10:2-4; Mrk 3:16-19; Luk 6:14-16.\x*
\v 14 They were united in their ongoing prayers¦81983, along with Maria¦81993 the mother¦81995 of \nd Yeshua\nd*, and his¦82002 brothers¦82001.
\p
\v 15 Then¦82003 one day, Peter¦82011 stood¦82009 up in the meeting of the believers¦82015 (about¦82028 120¦82030 of them) and¦82019 said¦82017,
