\v 18 (Yudas had bought a field with the money¦82079 he had received for his treachery, and when he had fallen down \add in that field\add*, his stomach had burst¦82086 open¦82086 and his intestines¦82092 had slid out \add on the ground\add*.\x + \xo 1:18-19: \xt Mat 27:3-8.\x*
