\v 25 to take¦82222 this position of service¦82228 and¦82230 being a missionary—the position that¦82234 Yudas¦82236 deserted to go to his own place.”
\v 26 So¦82245 they¦82246 drew straws and¦82245 Matthias¦82255 was marked so he was chosen¦82259 to join the eleven¦82263 missionaries.
\c 2
