\v 47 praising¦83302 \nd God¦83304\nd* and being popular with the people¦83312, and every¦83319 day¦83320 \nd Yahweh¦83315\nd* was adding¦83316 more that were being saved¦83318.
\c 3
\s1 A lame man starts bouncing around
