\v 15 However in doing so, you¦83703 killed¦83703 the creator of life¦83702, who \nd God¦83706\nd* then raised¦83707 from the dead¦83709 as we¦83712 can attest.
\v 16 Now it's \add our\add* faith in the authority of Yeshua that has strengthened¦83728 \add the legs\add* of this man that you have¦83726 seen and that you already knew¦83726—this authority and faith that comes from Yeshua completely¦83741 healed¦83741 this man right in front¦83743 of you¦83724 all¦83724.
\p
\v 17 So¦83746 now, friends, I know¦83751 that you did¦83757 \add all\add* that in ignorance¦83756, just like your¦83763 leaders,
\v 18 but¦83765 \add actually\add* \nd God¦83766\nd* was fulfilling¦83780 what he'd had written by the prophets¦83774, that the \nd messiah¦83778\nd* should suffer¦83776.
