\v 21 \add For now\add* it¦83816 is appropriate¦83816 for heaven¦83817 to receive¦83819 him¦83839, until¦83820 the times¦83821 of restoration¦83823 of everything, which¦83825 \add again\add* \nd God¦83828\nd* has had written by the faithful prophets¦83840.
\v 22 Indeed¦83842 Mosheh¦83841 said¦83844, ‘Our¦83858 \nd God¦83857 Yahweh¦83855\nd* will raise¦83854 up a prophet¦83851 for you that's like one of your¦83864 own brothers¦83862. You¦83851 must¦83854 listen to everything he says—whatever he tells you.\x + \xo 3:22: \xt Deu 18:15,18 (LXX).\x*
