\v 2 And he replied, “My brothers¦86211 and¦86207 fathers¦86213, please listen¦86214. Our¦86222 honoured \nd God¦86216\nd* was seen¦86219 by our¦86222 ancestor Abraham¦86223 in Mesopotamia¦86227 before¦86228 he moved to Haran¦86233\x + \xo 7:2-3: \xt Gen 12:1.\x*
