\v 4 So¦86269 he left Chaldea¦86264 and moved to Haran¦86268, and then¦86269 after¦86272 his¦86277 father¦86276 died¦86274, he moved again to this land where we now live.\x + \xo 7:4: a \xt Gen 11:31; \xo b \xt Gen 12:4.\x*
\v 5 Abraham hadn't received any land here as an inheritance¦86301, in fact he'd never been near this land and nor did he have any children¦86328, yet God promised¦86309 to give¦86311 this \add entire\add* country to him and his¦86321 descendants¦86320.\x + \xo 7:5: \xt Gen 12:7; 13:15; 15:18; 17:8.\x*
\v 6 And yet \nd God¦86334\nd* \add also\add* told him¦86342 that his¦86342 descendants¦86340 would end up staying in another¦86346 country where they would be enslaved¦86348 and mistreated¦86352 for four¦86355 hundred¦86355 years¦86354.\x + \xo 7:6-7: \xt Gen 15:13-14.\x*
