\v 15 So¦86544 Yacob¦86547 went¦86545 to Egypt¦86549, where he and¦86544 the \add twelve\add* tribal leaders eventually died¦86551,\x + \xo 7:15: a \xt Gen 46:1-7; \xo b \xt Gen 49:33.\x*
\v 16 although their bodies were moved to Shekem where they were put¦86564 into the tomb¦86567 that¦86569 Abraham¦86571 had bought from the sons¦86576 of Hamor.\x + \xo 7:16: \xt Gen 23:3-16; 33:19; 50:7-13; Josh 24:32.\x*
\p
\v 17 But¦86602 as the time¦86588 limit promised¦86593 to Abraham¦86598 by \nd God¦86596\nd* was getting closer, \add our\add* people¦86601 multiplied¦86603 in Egypt¦86605\x + \xo 7:17-18: \xt Exo 1:7-8.\x*
\v 18 until¦86606 another¦86610 Far'oh \add !(Pharaoh)\add* ended up ruling there who had¦86616 never known¦86616 Yosef.
