\v 20 Mosheh¦86647 was born¦86646 during that time¦86644 and¦86648 \nd God¦86652\nd* considered him beautiful¦86650. He spent three¦86656 months¦86655 in his \add own\add* father's¦86661 house¦86659\x + \xo 7:20: \xt Exo 2:2.\x*
