\v 26 So¦86771 on the following¦86772 day¦86773 when he saw¦86774 two of them quarrelling¦86776, he tried to resolve the situation by saying¦86789, ‘Men, you're all brothers¦86793. Why are you injuring¦86798 each other?’
\v 27 But¦86813 the bullying one pushed¦86806 him¦86807 away and¦86813 said¦86808, ‘Who made you¦86810 the judge¦86814 over us?
