\v 29 When¦86834 he heard that¦86839, Mosheh¦86835 fled¦86833 \add Egypt\add* and¦86834 became¦86841 an exile in Midian¦86845 where¦86846 he \add eventually\add* had two¦86849 sons¦86848.\x + \xo 7:29: \xt Exo 18:3-4.\x*
\p
\v 30 After another forty¦86858 years¦86856, he was in the wilderness¦86863 around Mt¦86865. Sinai¦86867 when he saw¦86859 a messenger¦86868 in the flame¦86871 of a burning¦86872 thorn¦86875 bush.\x + \xo 7:30-34: \xt Exo 3:1-10.\x*
