\v 38 Now Mosheh was the person that \add led\add* the assembly¦87081 \add of people\add* in the wilderness¦87084, was spoken¦87089 to by one \add of God's\add* messengers¦87087 on Mt¦87093. Sinai¦87094, and¦87095 one of our¦87099 ancestors¦87097 that received¦87102 living¦87105 messages to pass on to us.\x + \xo 7:38: \xt Exo 19:1–20:17; Deu 5:1-33.\x*
