\v 39 “Yet our¦87117 ancestors¦87116 didn't¦87111 want to obey that man, so they rejected him and¦87120 started thinking about Egypt¦87133 again,
\v 40 saying¦87134 to Aaron¦87136, ‘Make some gods¦87139 for us to lead us because¦87144 we've got no idea what happened to that¦87146 Mosheh¦87145 who led¦87150 us out of Egypt¦87154.’\x + \xo 7:40: \xt Exo 32:1.\x*
