\v 42 But¦87186 \nd God¦87185\nd* turned¦87181 and allowed them to serve¦87189 the heavenly¦87193 armies, just as the prophets¦87199 wrote¦87195,\x + \xo 7:42-43: \xt Amos 5:25-27 (LXX).\x*
