\p
\v 44 The tent¦87247 of evidence was with our¦87255 ancestors¦87253 in the wilderness¦87258—made¦87266 to the pattern¦87272 that God had¦87274 shown Mosheh¦87265.\x + \xo 7:44: \xt Exo 25:9,40.\x*
\v 45 Our¦87282 ancestors¦87281 then carried that¦87276 tent into the land, having¦87279 inherited¦87279 it along with Joshua from the possession¦87288 of the pagans which¦87276 \nd God¦87294\nd* drove¦87292 out ahead of them. The tent remained there until¦87301 the time¦87303 of David¦87304\x + \xo 7:45: \xt Josh 3:14-17.\x*
\v 46 who found¦87306 favour¦87307 with \nd God¦87310\nd* and¦87311 requested¦87312 to find¦87313 a tent¦87314 for the house¦87317 of Yacob¦87319,\x + \xo 7:46: \xt 2Sam 7:1-16; 1Ch 17:1-14.\x*
\v 47 but¦87321 it was Solomon¦87320 who built¦87322 the house¦87325 for God \add to reside in\add*.\x + \xo 7:47: \xt 1Ki 6:1-38; 2Ch 3:1-17.\x*
