\v 51 You stiff-necked people with uncircumcised¦87380 hearts¦87385 and ears¦87389! You're always¦87391 opposing¦87396 the holy¦87395 \nd spirit¦87393\nd* just like your¦87401 ancestors¦87400 were.\x + \xo 7:51: \xt Isa 63:10.\x*
\v 52 Which¦87405 one of the prophets¦87407 wasn't persecuted¦87409 by your¦87413 ancestors¦87412? Even the ones that foretold¦87418 the coming of the righteous¦87424 one were killed¦87415 off by them in just the same way that you yourselves became¦87432 his betrayers¦87428 and¦87414 murderers¦87430!
\v 53 You'd received¦87434 the law¦87436 under the direction of messengers¦87439, and¦87440 yet you didn't¦87441 obey it¦87442.”
\s1 Stephen's lynching and death
