\v 54 When¦87446 they heard¦87444 that, they were raging inside and¦87446 grating¦87454 their¦87456 teeth¦87457 at him¦87459.
\v 55 But¦87474 being¦87460 full¦87462 of the holy¦87466 \nd spirit¦87465\nd*, Stephen stared up into the sky and¦87474 was able to see God's splendour¦87472, as well as seeing \nd Yeshua\nd* standing¦87478 there on God's right¦87480.
