\p
\v 57 At this point, they blocked their¦87511 ears¦87510 and¦87512 rushed¦87513 together to grab Stephen, yelling loudly¦87507.
\v 58 They drove him out of the city¦87522 and¦87517 then¦87517 started throwing¦87518 rocks at him. His accusers left their¦87532 cloaks in the care of a young¦87537 man¦87537 named¦87539 Saul¦87540.
