\v 3 As for Saul¦87638, he started on destroying the assembly¦87643 by entering¦87647 people's homes and dragging¦87648 both men¦87651 and women¦87653 out and then off to prison¦87657.\x + \xo 8:3: \xt Acts 22:4-5; 26:9-11.\x*
\s1 Philip preaches in Shomron/Samaria
