\v 9 One man¦87742 in the city¦87751 had been practicing¦87752 magic¦87752 and amazing¦87754 the people¦87757, and he claimed that he was someone¦87762 great¦87764. His name¦87745 was Simon¦87746
\v 10 and the people there from the least to the most important said¦87772, “This power is from the great \nd god¦87778\nd*.”
