\v 13 Simon¦87822 himself¦87824 also believed¦87825 and was immersed¦87827, and then¦87821 started accompanying Philip¦87832 around—marvelling¦87844 as he observed¦87833 the miracles¦87839 and signs¦87837 of God's power.
