\p
\v 34 “Now tell¦88297 me,” said¦88290 the official, “who was Yeshayah talking about? Was he talking about himself¦88300 or someone¦88304 else?”
\v 35 So¦88306 Philip¦88308 started with that¦88317 passage and¦88306 explained the good¦88319 message¦88319 about \nd Yeshua¦88322\nd* to him.
